A||N||38||1FST2M6||Spiral Max... no thanks i'll pass||||1||
Z||000000||1FST2M6||11-18-2000||07:27 PM||||well i recieved Lou Diaz' Spiral Max in the UPS yesterday (friday-17th) here is what it looks like for those of you not really really sure.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/spiralmax1.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/spiralmax2.jpg"> <P><BR>the Spiral Max unit installed per Lous instructions with the "cut over the valve cover breather tube, so as not to block it off" <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/spiralinstalledb_1.jpg"> <P><BR>Ed and i ran the car two (2) times for a baseline run than ran it Four (4) times with the spiral max. we disconnected the battery and ran the car on the dyno at varying speeds for about 3 minutes then shut the car off let it sit for about 5 min then ran the actual test with the winPEP software reading the car (not just using the brake like when the car is RE-learning the air/fuel/timing per Spiral Max's instructions)<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/spiraldyno.jpg"> <P>as you can see my WEAK automatic GT  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> layed down 103.6HP with 132.2lbft of torque. but after testing and even turning the spiral max around the incorrect direction (just to see on the last run, which turned out the best actually) i STILL LOST  with the SPIRAL MAX unit installed BACKWARDS our best figures were 102.3hp and 130.5lbft of torque. with the unit installed correctly (i can post those numbers too) my numbers were 100.8hp and 128.9lbft. in my opinion Hardly worth the $...  I have 3-4 videos of the Car on the dyno and of the computer screne right after the run if anyone wants it.  and for those skeptical about my current exhaust not making more hp.. no i can't prove it made more hp over the stock. but how i was able to judge the increase was before i couldn't chirp 2nd with the 17s.. i can chirp them EVERY time it pops into 2nd now! probly only 8-10lbft more but enough to chirp a 235-40-17.. good enough... FOR NOW!   questions.. comments..  Lou i'll send that back on monday.. FedEx i'll mail ya a tracking number. Thanks for being the forums test mouse!<BR>||||reg||1
