Z||000006||Shaun41178||11-18-2000||10:16 PM||||Yea that looks like a flimsy piece of sh!t.  Like someone made cuts and then twisted it to form a pinwheel shape or something.<P>So you lost like -4 hp and -3 torque peak?  Ohh ohh I think that can of Coke is mine.  I will have to go back and check the other Spiralmax post but I think I said -4 hp and -2 torque.  Ohlala I think that Coke is mine.  Payup Travis.<P>And thanks for testing that for all the forum members.  I myself would have never bought one but I still appreciate what you did for all the members here.  <P>Seems like the guy who stated the 20 hp increase on the Spiralmax website needs to recalibrate his @ss-o-meter.<P>------------------<BR>Shaun-Toledo OH, 85 GT<BR>2.8 With nitrous<BR>Soon to have a 3.2 with nitrous<BR>0-60 in 5.6 seconds<BR><A HREF="http://members.aol.com/Shaun41178" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Performance</A>||||reg||1
