Z||000027||DaRkLoRD||11-20-2000||05:42 PM||||The principle is sound...... but to the extent that a spiral increases the flow in a straight line.. for something like the Fiero intake it's just an obstruction.<BR>keep in mind it likely does work in some applications... just not all!<P>I'd have to see a lot more negative proof (via dyno tests) to label the whole product a scam. I do, however, think many of their testimonials are likely exaggerated or possibly outright fabrications... but not all.<P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||8
