Z||000031||DaRkLoRD||11-20-2000||07:11 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Formula:<BR><B>I just have a comment........<P>if a car is on a dyno, then its not moving and not getting the ram air effect....<P>wouldnt the car need to be moving for spiral max to work?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Hmm.. good point.. I'd thought of that originally, but then forgot about it. heh.. perhaps dynos should be outfitted with high flow fans to simulate airflow??<P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||1
